"The payment methods, such as manual or cheque, that the journals offer for "
"incoming and outgoing payments."
msgstr ""
"Die Zahlungsmethoden, z. B. manuell oder Scheck, die die Journale für ein- "
"und ausgehende Zahlungen anbieten."

#. module: om_account_accountant
#: model_terms:ir.actions.act_window,help:om_account_accountant.action_moves_to_review
